WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:07.500
The future speaks in data. We anticipate it with decisions. FastAnalytics is research, science and technology.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:21.800
A platform that brings together mathematical modeling, data analytics and artificial intelligence, to anticipate security threats, organized crime, money laundering and disaster risks.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:36.200
Data. The territory reports through every channel, with facial recognition and license plate recognition built in. Eyes on every phone and on video surveillance cameras, anonymously and offline too.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:47.800
Analysis. Artificial intelligence and the analysts' judgment turn that data into information useful for deciding, in seconds, not weeks.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:58.500
Command. Organizations coordinate the response on a single dashboard, with reports and traceability in real time. Everyone notified, everyone active.

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:08.300
Foresight. The Decisional Enneagon turns the weak signal into tomorrow's decision, every day and in every crisis.

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:21.400
Less harm to your people on the ground, media management, reputation protection and immediate information for your decision-makers, every day and in crisis.

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:30.400
And with CeciTeaches, everything learned stays available 24/7, for any question about the platform or the technical side.

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:55.400
This already happened, and it has method. Twenty twenty-one, homicide, univariate outlier detection. Ibague twenty twenty-two, multiple crimes, non-parametric spatio-temporal models. December twenty twenty-four, multiple crimes, multivariate outlier detection.

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:58.700
FastAnalytics. Book a demo.
